 *   **Memory Complexity:** Requires storing $P_{min}$ and $P_{max}$ per macrocell [S1].
-*   **Measured Performance:**
-    *   **Thunder Dataset:** Reduces total processing time by 43.00%. Mean culling rate is 14.23%, max culling rate is 43.06% [S1].
